Not all adventurers seek forture, not all that defend the world have good deeds in mind.
Lately the number of sightings of horrors have grown tremoundously. People wander off the beaten paths only to be found years later, horribly mutated and partly insane, if they are found at all. It is becoming evident something is stirring deep below Maj'Eyal.
